        },
        {
          "text": "UBileyamu wayesethi kuBalaki: “Ngakhele lapha ama-altare ayisikhombisa, ungilungisele lapha izinkabi eziyisikhombisa nezinqama eziyisikhombisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.1",
