              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabonanga bubi kuJakobe, no-Israyeli akabonanga nkohliso; uJehova uNkulunkulu wakhe unaye, nokukhala kwenkosi kuphakathi kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
