              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngempela, akukho umlingo ngokumelene noJakobe, futhi akukho ukubhula ngokumelene no-Israyeli; ngalesi sikhathi kuyakuthiwa ngoJakobe nango-Israyeli: Yini uNkulunkulu ayenzileyo!",
