              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uBileyamu waphendula wathi kuBalaki: “Angikutshelanga yini ngokuthi: Konke uJehova akukhulumayo ngiyakukwenza na?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
