        },
        {
          "text": "UBalaki wayesethi kuBileyamu: “Woza, ngikuyise kwenye indawo; mhlawumbe kungaba kuhle kuNkulunkulu ukuthi ungiqalekisele bona ulapho.",
          "type": "text",
